         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Draw to Count\n\nOn this screen you will learn how numbers are represented on the Yupana. First, use the arrows below to watch numbers grow from right to left. Then compare the dots on the screen with the tips of your fingers. Finally, notice that no Yupana line can represent a number greater than 9.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
